k-Z_K9WTQw9JbR9O1PX_xDs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEMtaeLzZoCIogpC8_Eo0NIIAc-A78hZmr2hUY-_Zqz1Q&oe=6A8042B4"}, "display_name": "BeamXR Live - Stream to Socials", "keywords": ["stream", "live", "chat", "social", "video"], "long_description": "**Stream any VR game, app, or experience directly from your Meta Quest \u2014 no PC, no cables, no extra setup.**\n\nWith BeamXR Live, it\u2019s easy to go live, chat with your audience, and share your world in real time.\n\n{752433410655377}\n\n**\ud83d\udd34 Go Live**\n\n\ud83c\udfa5 Stream any Quest game, app, or experience\n\n\ud83d\udd34 Go live on Twitch or YouTube with one tap\n\n\u2699\ufe0f Stream to any RTMP platform\n\n\ud83d\udcac See your live chat inside your headset\n\n\ud83c\udfa8 Personalise your stream with images, text, and more\n\n\ud83e\uddd1 Stream your Meta Avatar to just chat and hang out\n\nWhether you\u2019re showing off your skills in top titles, exploring new MR apps, or just chilling as your avatar - BeamXR Live makes it simple.\n\n{1287617452754511}\n\n\n{1964323080997819}\n\n**\u26a0\ufe0f Known Issues (Early Access):**\n- In some multiplayer games that use voice chat, your mic may not be heard on stream\n\nWe\u2019re in early access and actively improving \u2014 your feedback helps shape what\u2019s next. Join our Discord to stay in the loop:  https://discord.com/invite/beamxr\n\nThanks for streaming with BeamXR Live!", "short_description": "Stream any XR game or app directly from your Meta Quest. Link your YouTube or Twitch account and go live in seconds - no PC required. See live chat in-headset and even stream as your Meta Avatar to just hang out."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://beamxr.io/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://beamxr.io/terms/", "publisher_name": "BeamXR", "support_website_url": "https://discord.com/invite/beamxr", "website_url": "https://beamxr.io/", "category": null, "comfort_r